    <dcterms:description>The validated IRI lexical value represented by an asserted-relation descriptor.</dcterms:description>
    <rdfs:label>has relation IRI lexical value</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A data property, a specialisation of 'has value', relating an asserted-relation descriptor to the IRI, given as an xsd:anyURI lexical value, of the relation it represents.</obo:IAO_0000115>
